# Design System

The UI must feel like a modern SaaS product (similar to Notion, Linear, Vercel).

---

# Principles

- Minimal
- Clean
- Functional
- Consistent

---

# Layout

- Sidebar navigation (primary)
- Topbar for actions and notifications
- Content centered with max-width
- Generous spacing

---

# Components

- Cards for grouping content
- Tables for structured data
- Modals for actions
- Dropdowns for secondary actions

---

# Spacing

- Use consistent spacing scale (Tailwind)
- Avoid cramped layouts
- Prioritize readability

---

# Colors

- Neutral base (gray/white)
- Accent color for actions
- Clear states:
  - success (green)
  - warning (yellow)
  - error (red)

---

# Typography

- Clear hierarchy:
  - Page title
  - Section title
  - Body
- Avoid excessive font variation

---

# UX Rules

- Every action must be obvious
- Avoid hidden interactions
- Prefer explicit buttons over implicit gestures
- Feedback must be immediate

---

# Reusability

- Components must be reusable
- Avoid one-off UI patterns